# The build context is build/, so these patterns are relative to build/.
#
# node_modules is excluded on purpose even though the image needs it: it is
# installed inside the image from the lockfile, so copying a host tree in would
# ship whatever a laptop happened to have, including native binaries built for
# the wrong platform. sharp is the one that would bite.

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/.content-snapshot
**/.local-site
**/.lambda-build
**/.terraform
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfplan
**/.lighthouseci
**/.lhci
**/.lhci-report
**/scratch
**/coverage
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
